        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, Loughshinny."
    },
    {
        "text": "The book you wanted. The sequel to the Steam Knights adventures."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Why', you ask?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I need a reason to do something for my beloved sister?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "But, do you really need to read it?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really need to read a book you have no interest in at all, but feel pressured by others our age to read?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "type": "char",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 1,
        "type": "bg",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#22$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I <i>do</i> want to read it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you tell Father you didn't want anyone asking you why a Victorian wouldn't enjoy stories about the Steam Knights?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This book... did Dad ask you to buy it for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because... how did you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're backing away from me, Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want you to be scared of me like everyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If me knowing what you told Father is so scary, how about we dance together to calm you down? Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A... dance? Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With those words, Eblana gracefully extends a hand towards her sister."
    },
    {
        "text": "But in Loughshinny's memories, even when her parents put on their favorite music, even when Father shook his head to the melody, even when Mother tapped her fingers to the beat..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her sister would only sit perfectly still while bearing an icy smile."
    },
    {
        "text": "She had never moved her body to any tune. Not even once."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1685_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once you can keep up with me, you'll no longer have to worry about any book, request, or even friends our age.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1684_1#25$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The unopened knight novel falls to the ground, and the pleasant new book smell is now drowned by muddy water."
    },
    {
        "text": "She was still young then. She never imagined that achieving her desires could feel so heavy and bitter. She only remembers stumbling, turning away, ignoring what was reaching out to her..."
    },
    {
        "text": "A soft and cold hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
