    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g4_dragonsquare_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The crowd is gone. You need no longer hide your identity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still think of them as alive, even now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only know that every Taran's heart burns with a similar flame. And that ever since our ancestors first bent the knee to the Victorians, that flame has never gone out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "That goes for all the townsfolk, as well as those who followed me back here. They all have the same fire, except that theirs has never been tainted by the shade of death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a wonderful analogy, Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let me ask you again: what will you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dye these flames in your own hue? I imagine you must have tried already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter who they are, once tainted by death, your flames can only render them into ash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I have a proposal, Loughshinny. Kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And everyone in the city as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it bothers you how this will be recorded in history, then you can just say that <i>I</i> killed them, and that you merely laid them to rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people of Na Saoirs\u00ed are still alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if what animates their bodies is not life, but death?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they were truly devoid of even the faintest spark of life, they would have long since become one of those hollow, shambling corpses you have wandering about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, they will. Eventually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they won't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather see the purple flames in them as a plague, one instigated by you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#15$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you plan to find a cure for it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to cure you of it as well, Eblana.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How wonderful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wonderful?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. That's absolutely wonderful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you not notice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "You aren't trying to run from me anymore. You're trying to <i>cure</i> me, of all things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "59_i05",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, dance with me, Loughshinny. The same dance I've always invited you to, the one you always ran from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I asked you to dance with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But before the final bar, be sure to pierce my heart with your spear. This plague is lethal, and there is no cure. I do not question your resolve, but your efforts will be in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've run from your fate long enough... From Na Saoirs\u00ed's fate, and ours too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not yet Samhain, but the boundary between life and death is more ambiguous than it has been in all of Taran history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you truly wish for Tara to become a kingdom of death?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny subconsciously turns her head away."
    },
    {
        "text": "The fierce purple flames still rage in the skeleton the hero dragged all the way here. Culann, now taken over by purple flames, briefly stands up before sinking back down to kneel."
    },
    {
        "text": "She cannot bear another look at him, so she turns her gaze back to her sister's eyes\u2014and the hand she's been offered for so many years."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is unclear if it is her imagination or a side effect of the purple flames depriving everything they touch of vitality, but the hand before her seems so pale and bloodless compared to the one in her memories."
    },
    {
        "text": "We speak of a city and the lives of countless people, Eblana. You cannot sum this up as a matter as simple as 'fate'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you finished? I believe we've spent enough time talking past each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Eblana!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but feel free to continue. If you so desire, I shall wait here for as long as you need me to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But do try not to take <i>too</i> long. You can afford to wait, yet that may not be true for others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Breathes deeply) You're right. <i>You</i> can afford to wait, but that may not be true for others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. I'll dance your dance. Until one of us falls and can dance no more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I will not follow your lead. Absolutely not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though you seem to have misunderstood something, my dear Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who cannot afford to wait is standing before you now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cannot afford to wait'?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny scrutinizes her sister's face as she suddenly realizes something entirely unrelated to their conversation."
    },
    {
        "text": "The offered hand is indeed pale, and it is not just her imagination."
    },
    {
        "text": "Purple flames seem to weave together into an omnipresent cloak, giving Eblana her beautiful yet terrifying appearance. Yet they also fail to conceal the malady which seems to consume her beneath her pale white skin."
    },
    {
        "text": "She shouldn't be like this. She was never like this before."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g4_dragonsquare_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eblana, are you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you... alright, Sister?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "A smile spreads across Eblana's face. The same old ice-cold smile is always found there."
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, it seems to bear some warmth, but this only highlights her conspicuous paleness."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate your concern. Really, I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#16$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all those apathetic partings and painful reunions, to only now hear you asking if I'm well... It has truly been so long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Incidentally, I really do want a dance with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will, once I find a way to heal you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_450_necras_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. Then I shall await you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_marblefootsteps_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "awalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "awalk",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eblana strides towards the citadel, her footsteps so faint that they seem almost frail."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
