        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$monastery_sad_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoo... Red dragon! Nemos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was no one at the gates when I got back! I thought something must've happened! What's going on in the square\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Red dragon... what's that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny is holding a small box in her arms. The dim night lights seem to make it harder than usual to see."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't save Culann. I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was the only way for him to rest in peace. So he'd no longer have to suffer from the flames in the square.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The nomad is silent for a long time, until she finds a stone on the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "She hurls it with all her strength towards the citadel."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the darkness of the night swallows it up, and it fails to even make a sound."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's already past curfew. Nemos, Brigid, let's just\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos reaches out to the wooden box, as if trying to brush nonexistent dust off the lid."
    },
    {
        "text": "She suddenly recalls being rejected by her own people a few days ago, and the superfluous words she heard then."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g5_remains_outside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wakemen do not stand with the living, nor do we require their reverence. Until, of course, they are dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>That</i> is the tradition Dublinn should be honoring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, I'm grateful you were at least willing to give me this whistle... I'll be going now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, Nemos. You knew well that Samhain approaches and the wakemen would be lacking sacred instruments. Yet you still came.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did the Dublinners force you to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I came here of my own\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos, you haven't changed one bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wait, mediate, and reconcile... Are you also like this in Na Saoirs\u00ed? Do you also serve the Red Dragon like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... don't want to see a situation that could be improved deteriorate any further. Or people who could have cooperated fighting each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If conflict is inevitable, you will only ever sink deeper into the mire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The city has tainted you with its darkness, Nemos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g4_dragonsquare_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, The Leader\u2014the Red Dragon\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eblana will never give Na Saoirs\u00ed true life? Is that right, Loughshinny?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said she couldn't. She... actually doesn't like to lie, unless there are other circumstances...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "She's The Leader of Tara, the one and only Red Dragon, what could possibly be tying her hands?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong, Nemos? You seem... different...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I get it. I finally get it, Your Highness Loughshinny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems that that fire can in fact infect the living.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people I once depended on turned out to be a swarm of selfish parasites.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Leader I once believed in turned out to be an evil dragon who doesn't care if anyone else lives or dies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people I once put my life on the line to protect... became the reason my closest friend died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't even imagine what they would have done to him if that wicked dragon hadn't lit him up with her flames.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Culann was right to ask what we would do once Samhain is over. What <i>should</i> I do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Other than revenge, there's nothing left for me either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_deathfire",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "avgdisplay",
        "id": 1,
        "style": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_purple_fire",
        "slot": "bgover",
        "x": 20,
        "y": -20,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "As she utters these words, Loughshinny sees a flame ignite within the final Na Saoirs\u00edan left untainted by the purple fire."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
