        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness, will you regard me the same as the rest of the residents\u2014a servant of Eblana?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. This deadly disease... It has ultimately infected even the last person in the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If so, Your Highness, then I swear to you that I will aid you in this dance that's been forced on you. Until the very end...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the wicked dragon falls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have heard your vow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, I must leave the city for a while. Come with me, Nemos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "To the wakemen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. I have no hope of curing the flame here, so I thought we should seek aid from anyone who might be able to help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I can't go with you. I have no right to be there anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll stay in the city. As long as the Red Dragon doesn't realize what's going on and tear me apart... I'll try my best to keep the situation from deteriorating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though, I'd appreciate it if you could return this whistle for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... Culann too. Please give him a proper funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "A proper funeral requires eulogies from friends and family, so... I'll write one. Could you read it for me there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
