        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here. It's done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go with Reed. The Dark Woods aren't lettin' anyone in or out, but it should be smoother with us two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Brigid. You should stay too. I need your help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be fine by myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That works, but... Nemos, you're so different now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I guess this is what vengeance does to a person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
